            "block_content": "(7) In any grievance arbitrated under the provisions of this Paragraph 7, the Company shall under no circumstances be liable for back pay for more than twelve (12) months (plus any time that the processing of the grievance or arbitration was delayed at the specific request of the Company) after the date of the disciplinary action. Delays requested by the Union in which the Company concurs shall not be included in such additional time.",
